{"candidateAnswer":"Around the third week of July 2023","evidence":"[D10:3 | 8:56 pm on 20 July, 2023] Caroline: Hey Mel! A lot's happened since we last chatted - I just joined a new LGBTQ activist group last Tues. I'm meeting so many cool people who are as passionate as I am about rights and community support. I'm giving my voice and making a real difference, plus it's fulfilling in so many ways. It's just great, you know?","itemId":"urn:uuid:fd8d9388-b512-56cc-83b2-ca01d428e6ff","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:12024d4fb844b444af94cab24f58e68a5fc3250c9aa5799cfc520457d62c808e","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did Caroline join a new activist group?","referenceAnswer":"The Tuesday before 20 July 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"12024d4fb844b444af94cab24f58e68a5fc3250c9aa5799cfc520457d62c808e"}}]}